# Transient messages (toasts)

- For success / error / warning / info banners in screens and widgets, use **`ToastTheme`** (`showSuccess`, `showError`, `showWarning`, `showInfo`, or `*Simple` variants) instead of **`SnackBar`**, **`ScaffoldMessenger.showSnackBar`**, or **`hideCurrentSnackBar`**.
- **Exception:** [`toast_theme.dart`](lib/presentation/widgets/common/toast_theme.dart) may use `SnackBar` internally for bottom “simple” toasts — do not copy that pattern into feature code.
- If you need something SnackBar-specific (e.g. a custom bottom banner with its own lifecycle), prefer an **overlay** or a dedicated widget — discuss before reintroducing `SnackBar` at call sites.
